{"n":101,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"ar":"ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"The Striking Calamity -","bn":"করাঘাতকারী,","tr":"Al qaari'ah","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":2,"ar":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"What is the Striking Calamity?","bn":"করাঘাতকারী কি?","tr":"Mal qaariah","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":3,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","bn":"করাঘাতকারী সম্পর্কে আপনি কি জানেন ?","tr":"Wa maa adraaka mal qaari'ah","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":4,"ar":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","bn":"যেদিন মানুষ হবে বিক্ষিপ্ত পতংগের মত","tr":"Yauma ya koonun naasu kal farashil mabthooth","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":5,"ar":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","bn":"এবং পর্বতমালা হবে ধুনিত রঙ্গীন পশমের মত।","tr":"Wa ta koonul jibalu kal 'ihnil manfoosh","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":6,"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","bn":"অতএব যার পাল্লা ভারী হবে,","tr":"Fa-amma man thaqulat mawa zeenuh","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":7,"ar":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","en":"He will be in a pleasant life.","bn":"সে সুখীজীবন যাপন করবে।","tr":"Fahuwa fee 'ishatir raadiyah","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":8,"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"But as for one whose scales are light,","bn":"আর যার পাল্লা হালকা হবে,","tr":"Wa amma man khaffat mawa zeenuh","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":9,"ar":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","en":"His refuge will be an abyss.","bn":"তার ঠিকানা হবে হাবিয়া।","tr":"Fa-ummuhu haawiyah","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":10,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","en":"And what can make you know what that is?","bn":"আপনি জানেন তা কি?","tr":"Wa maa adraaka maa hiyah","juz":30,"page":600},{"n":11,"ar":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","en":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","bn":"প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি!","tr":"Naarun hamiyah","juz":30,"page":600}]}